 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? They can save you quite a lot of time too, especially if it' a busy church venue. That's a good reason to use one. They keep track of everything from guest lists to certificates, and can even sort out the reception so it doesn't take forever. It is, and you can often pick a weekday against a quieter day. Many wedding planners do similar projects too, so it' worth asking about. They' love the detail about your mom too, it shows you' thought about her.",
